+# Runbook: Proving RT/HIL, Controller Certification, Perception Coverage, Supply Chain & Carbon Gates
+
+Purpose
+- This runbook guides operators through the actions required to close the remaining gaps for RT proofs, HIL certification, perception long-tail validation, supply-chain provenance and carbon gating.
+
+Steps
+1) Hardware RT Sweep
+ - Prepare representative ECUs/controllers and network topologies (CAN, CAN‑FD, TSN).
+ - Run: TARGETS="ecu1:can0,ecu2:eth0" COSIGN_KMS_URI=... S3_UPLOAD=s3://... ./ops/av/rt/run_hw_rt_sweep.sh --out /tmp/rt_sweep
+ - Inspect per-target rt_slo_proof.json and aggregate report /tmp/rt_sweep_agg_*.json. Ensure p99_ok & safe_ok are true.
+
+2) HIL Campaigns & Certification
+ - Prepare golden traces and scenario runners.
+ - Run HIL campaign manager: python3 ops/robotics/control/certified/hil_campaign_manager.py --scenarios "cmd1" "cmd2" --golden /opt/aegis/golden_trace.ndjson --out /tmp/hil_campaign
+ - Triage open GH issues created by harness and iterate on controllers.
+ - When passing, produce final signed certification bundle via existing cert harness and submission_package.
+
+3) Perception Large-Scale Simulation & OOD
+ - Generate scenario packs and run at scale: python3 ops/av/perception/scale/run_simulation_cluster.py --packs 20 --scenarios-per-pack 100 --parallel 8 --out /tmp/sim_run
+ - Review failures in failures.json and push failing scenarios to HIL via hil_adapter_stub.
+ - Use results to build adversarial datasets and retrain/harden ensembles.
+
+4) Supply-Chain Provenance Enforcement
+ - Ensure all builder runners are labeled and hardened per ops/hw/ci/runner_provision/ansible_provision_sample.yml.
+ - Use workflow .github/workflows/enforce_strict_provenance.yml to block promotions if images lack cosign signatures or Rekor provenance.
+
+5) Carbon Gate Tuning
+ - Run monitor mode to collect rolling intensity statistics: python3 ops/carbon/carbon_gate_tuner.py --mode monitor --out /tmp/carbon_monitor.log
+ - Tune Aegis_CARBON_PROMOTE_THRESHOLD_GCO2 and window size until acceptable false positive rate.
+ - Use enforce mode in CI with cosign-signed override artifacts for emergency promotions.
+
+6) Evidence & Submission
+ - Use ops/av/ops/safety_case_builder.py and ops/av/certifier/submission_package.py to assemble and sign submission bundles for certifiers.
+ - Keep artifacts in S3 per ops/governance/evidence_retention_policy.md.
+
+Escalation & Roles
+- Platform Owner: signs override artifacts, provides COSIGN_KMS_URI, coordinates with certifiers.
+- Controls Lead: triages HIL failures and updates controllers.
+- Perception Lead: triages OOD failures and updates models/ensembles.
+- Infra Operator: provisions/hardens runner fleet and configures CI secrets.
